    "21 to 23 April 2027, at the Kenyatta International Convention Centre in Nairobi. See the <a href=\"/venue/\">venue page</a>.": "2027年4月21日至23日,在Nairobi的Kenyatta International Convention Centre举行。请参阅<a href=\"/venue/\">场地页面</a>。",
